# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# This is a *UI* credential for driving the browser. It is deliberately NOT the
# same thing as the cnit OAuth token, which is cnit's own business and lives
# DPAPI-encrypted under the `shiftpay-admin` profile.
#
# The account needs to see its own calendar at /shiftpay?id=fill_shift and, for
# the manager cases, to have at least one direct reportee. `admin` satisfies
# both on dev227442: six direct reportees, and a calendar of its own that starts
# empty. The seeder deliberately refuses to seed the manager as their own
# reportee, and the writing cases create their own data two months ahead anyway,
# so an empty admin calendar is the expected starting state, not a gap.

SN_INSTANCE=https://dev227442.service-now.com
SN_USER=
SN_PASSWORD=
